{"id":"inconscient","lemma":"inconscient","pos":"adj","rank":3337,"glosses":["unthinking, unaware","unconscious","irresponsible"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.kɔ̃.sjɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cf/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-inconscient.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-inconscient.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"inconsciente","masculinePlural":"inconscients","femininePlural":"inconscientes"},"formAudio":{"inconsciente":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/92/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sagnamadr-inconsciente.wav","inconscients":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-inconscients.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il était inconscient du danger.","en":"He was not aware of the danger.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Elle est inconsciente.","en":"She's unconscious.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"J'étais inconscient de sa présence.","en":"I was not conscious of her presence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2745","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"presence"}]},{"text":"Elle fut inconsciente durant trois jours.","en":"She was unconscious for three days.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},null,{"g":"during, while"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"day","l":"jour"}]},{"text":"Il était inconscient de sa culpabilité.","en":"He was unconscious of his guilt.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"guilt"}]}]}